dark chocolate as described in that paper (Table 1).
We then needed an accurate way to model the varied consumption of chocolate.
We explored creating a sinusoidal function that had multiple peaks at the beginning
and end of the year. But, we felt that it might be too simplistic to accurately model
this process. While searching for average yearly chocolate consumption data, we found
